      "verbatim_texts": [
        "The process starts with BUSINESS PROCESS REQUIREMENTS"
      ],
      "justification": "Initiates the process and covers the starting phase. The redundant 'start' action and structural init preserve behaviour without altering the flow."
    },
    {
      "refs": [
        "action:n3"
      ],
      "verbatim_texts": [
        "followed by SAP Configuration."
      ],
      "justification": "Directly models the second sequential step."
    },
    {
      "refs": [
        "action:n5"
      ],
      "verbatim_texts": [
        "After that, it moves on to Communications Design."
      ],
      "justification": "Accurately captures the Communications Design phase."
    },
    {
      "refs": [
        "action:n6"
      ],
      "verbatim_texts": [
        "Then, it proceeds to Learning Design."
      ],
      "justification": "Accurately captures the Learning Design phase."
    },
    {
      "refs": [
        "action:n7"
      ],
      "verbatim_texts": [
        "Next, it involves Data Conversion Design & Test."
      ],
      "justification": "Accurately captures the Data Conversion Design & Test phase."
    },
    {
      "refs": [
        "action:n4"
      ],
      "verbatim_texts": [
        "Once the SAP Configuration is completed, it moves on to IT Design, Development & Functional Test."
      ],
      "justification": "Models the IT Design phase triggered post-SAP configuration. Minor punctuation omission in the model content does not change behaviour."
    },
    {
      "refs": [
        "action:n9"
      ],
      "verbatim_texts": [
        "Similarly, after Communications Design, it moves on to Communications Deployment."
      ],
      "justification": "Directly models the Communications Deployment step following its predecessor."
    },
    {
      "refs": [
        "action:n10"
      ],
      "verbatim_texts": [
        "After Learning Design, it proceeds to Learning Deployment."
      ],
      "justification": "Directly models the Learning Deployment step following its predecessor."
    },
    {
      "refs": [
        "action:n8"
      ],
      "verbatim_texts": [
        "Following Data Conversion Design & Test, it moves on to Integration Test. Once IT Design, Development & Functional Test is completed, it proceeds to Integration Test."
      ],
      "justification": "Captures Integration Test and correctly models the convergence from two parallel branches using appropriate structural plumbing. Behaviour is fully preserved."
    },
    {
      "refs": [
        "action:n11"
      ],
      "verbatim_texts": [
        "After Communications Deployment, it moves on to Deployment. Similarly, after Learning Deployment, it proceeds to Deployment. Following Integration Test, it moves on to Deployment."
      ],
      "justification": "Models the Deployment phase and correctly joins the three concurrent work streams before proceeding."
    },
    {
      "refs": [
        "action:n12"
      ],
      "verbatim_texts": [
        "Finally, after Deployment, it enters the PRODUCTION SUPPORT phase, and the process comes to an end."
      ],
      "justification": "Captures the final production support step and correctly terminates the process."
    }
  ],
